{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30653","headline":"书情献知己 · 姚鹄","name":"书情献知己","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日日恨何穷，巴云旧隐空。\n一爲栖寓客，二见北归鸿。\n有道期攀桂，无门息转蓬。\n赁居将罄比，乞食与僧同。\n花月登临处，江山怅望中。\n衆皆轻病骥，谁肯救焦桐。\n坐惜春还至，愁吟夜每终。\n谷寒思变律，叶晚怯回风。\n谒蔡慙王粲，怜衡冀孔融。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30653.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30653","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}